{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/13/5637721/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の日記ー(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はボイトレと、浪漫の撮影でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつ放送かなー。ぜひチェックしてみてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスンは、歌う体力をつけてこーてことで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌いながら踊りながらってのを頑張ったんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーもー大変ですね('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほかのアイドルさんたち、すごいなーて思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂も頑張らんとね(`・∀・')＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えいえいおーよっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーそれからっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっか (伊藤万理華chan)と一緒に途中まで帰ったー(o>ω<o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろお話ししたのよ。いろいろお話ししたの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっか大好きー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は大阪！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみすぎるね///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵なパフォーマンスができますよーうに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、大阪の街楽しんでやるぞー(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/13/5637721/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度から「46」とか「146」とか「246」とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「46」がらみのキリ番の人にスペコメするとかしてくれない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー試しに今日やってみよう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/13/5637721/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/13/5637721/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんって髪染めてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう。それ書かなきゃだよね。それ大事だよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つまり昨日のブログは、「ひめたん茶髪になったみたいだよー不思議ねー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って意味だったの。ライトの加減だと思うんだけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際まっくろです(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/13/5637721/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道では鳥の唐揚げのこと、ザンギって呼ぶんだよ、知ってた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ざんぎー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か、かっくいーいい(*/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんも使おかなーとかゆーてきっと夜には忘れちょん←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/13/5637721/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは暑いの大丈夫？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは暑いの大丈夫じゃないよ('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうやばし。ばてばて。しかも汗っかきだからねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/13/5637721/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんごビームはひめたんにはできるの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"できるよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん天才だもーんどや(`・ω・')"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/13/5637721/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問やけど、ひめたんは祇園祭は見たことある??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なーい←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこのお祭り？簡単に教えてくださーい☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/13/5637721/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プール行って泳ぐの続けてるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月曜はお仕事しとったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それ以外毎日行ってるからねー(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"決めたの。この夏は、時間を見つけて泳ぐ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/13/5637721/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏と言ったら‥？高校野球だよね？w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"な、夏と言ったら、高校野球しか..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"確かに夏と言ったら高校野球ってのもありですよ(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それがイコールになるかと聞かれたら..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やー繋がる、かな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/13/5637721/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんビームは、一度に何人に有効なんでしょうか？(゜o゜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんビームはそんな、誰にでも送ったりしないよーっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あなたにだけしか送りません///きゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/13/5637721/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"作文得意ですか？得意だったらアドバイス下さい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分で得意って言えないけど、好きな分野ではあります∩・ω・∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっこいい単語を並べたら、「何こいつかっこよくね？ー」てなるはず！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真似せんほうがいいかもよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/13/5637721/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに一番自信ある科目は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家庭科！わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は数学もなかなか頑張ったー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん(*´・ω・*)"}],"source":"archive"}